@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Creazione Ordine (Versione Semplificata)

actor Cameriere
participant "WaiterController" as WC
participant "SceneManager" as SM
participant "TakeOrderController" as TOC
participant "ProductLoadingService" as PLS
participant "MenuUseCase" as MU
participant "DatabaseService" as DS
participant "OrderReviewDialog" as ORD
participant "OrderUseCase" as OU
participant "OrderService" as OS
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Inizializzazione Presa Ordine ==

Cameriere -> WC: handleNewOrder()
activate WC
WC -> SM: showTakeOrder(numeroTavolo)
activate SM
SM -> TOC**: create & init(numeroTavolo)
activate TOC

TOC -> TOC: initLoadingIndicator()
note right: Setup ProgressIndicator\ne overlay UI

TOC -> PLS**: create service
activate PLS
TOC -> PLS: configure callbacks\n(onSucceeded, onFailed)
deactivate PLS

TOC -> TOC: setupSearch()
note right: Debouncing 300ms\nThread dedicato ricerca

TOC -> TOC: loadProductsAsync()

SM --> WC: void
deactivate SM
deactivate WC

== Caricamento Asincrono Prodotti ==

TOC -> TOC: showLoadingIndicator(true)
TOC -> PLS: start()
activate PLS

PLS -> PLS: createTask() in background
note right: Thread separato\nper operazioni DB

PLS -> MU: loadAllProducts()
activate MU
MU -> DS: getAllProducts()
activate DS
DS -> DB: SELECT * FROM menu_items
activate DB
DB --> DS: ResultSet
deactivate DB
DS --> MU: List<MenuProduct>
deactivate DS
MU --> PLS: List<MenuProduct>
deactivate MU

PLS -> TOC: onSucceeded callback
deactivate PLS

TOC -> TOC: Platform.runLater:\nupdateProductList(products)
note right: Aggiorna UI con\nprodotti raggruppati\nper categoria

TOC -> TOC: showLoadingIndicator(false)

deactivate TOC

== Ricerca Prodotti (con Debouncing) ==

Cameriere -> TOC: type in searchField
activate TOC
TOC -> TOC: debounce timer (300ms)

... attesa 300ms ...

TOC -> TOC: performSearch() in background
note right: Filtra cache prodotti\nper nome/categoria/allergeni

TOC -> TOC: Platform.runLater:\nupdateProductList(filtered)
note right: Visual feedback:\nbordo verde/rosso,\ntooltip, animazione

deactivate TOC

== Selezione Prodotti ==

Cameriere -> TOC: click increment prodotto
activate TOC
TOC -> TOC: incrementProductQuantity()
note right: Aggiorna carrello\nMap<productId, OrderItem>

TOC -> TOC: updateSendButton()
note right: "Send Order (N)"

TOC -> TOC: loadProductsAsync()
note right: Refresh UI mostra\nquantità aggiornate

deactivate TOC

== Invio Ordine ==

Cameriere -> TOC: click Send Order
activate TOC

alt carrello vuoto
    TOC -> Cameriere: Alert "Carrello vuoto"
else modalità E-Ink
    TOC -> OU: createOrder(items, tavolo, "", user)
    note right: Invio diretto\nsenza dialog review
else modalità Standard
    TOC -> ORD**: show review dialog
    activate ORD
    ORD -> ORD: display items, calcola totale
    ORD --> Cameriere: mostra dialog
    
    Cameriere -> ORD: conferma
    ORD -> TOC: callback(note)
    deactivate ORD
    
    TOC -> OU: createOrder(items, tavolo, note, user)
end

activate OU
OU -> OS: createOrder()
activate OS
OS -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
OS -> DB: INSERT INTO orders
OS -> DB: INSERT INTO order_items (loop)
OS -> DB: COMMIT
DB --> OS: success
deactivate DB
OS --> OU: true
deactivate OS
OU --> TOC: true
deactivate OU

TOC -> TOC: clearCart()
TOC -> SM: showWaiter()
activate SM
SM --> TOC: void
deactivate SM

TOC --> Cameriere: "Successo"

deactivate TOC

== Cleanup (al cambio schermata) ==

TOC -> TOC: cleanup()
activate TOC
note right: Shutdown executor ricerca\nCancel service caricamento
deactivate TOC

@enduml
